Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）这就是今天的对战对手吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得好好准备一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉丝福利才行啊。呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.23,0:00:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）还是老样子，真恶趣味啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然特意挑自己的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}推入地狱……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找对战者可是很辛苦的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟粉丝太多了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个个全都是菜鸟决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，累死我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}收集 No.卡也不轻松啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，那 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就不能更珍惜一点吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？有意见的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己也亲手去收集不就好了，V。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在还不是我出动的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦……你是想说我是你的棋子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.15,0:01:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要的话，就在这里做个了断……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.34,0:01:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）哥哥们！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请住手。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打架什么的，可不好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我闭嘴。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）不，说得没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）……你有点话说得太过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能像那两人一样忘了高贵之心啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆……我是问题儿童是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说话注意点。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.59,0:01:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对托隆的无礼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不答应。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了啦……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天你的职责你明白的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）是的，V哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙是正红着眼四处寻找。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那枚 No.卡交给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙一定会出现在你们面前吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.07,0:01:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是，V哥哥大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.03,0:02:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡博士……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要从那家伙手里夺走一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像那家伙对我们所做的那样……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）V……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千万别让人察觉到我的事哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡博士以为我已经死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让人知道我的存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我的职责啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）勇敢的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者诸位！早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗狂欢节也进入第二天了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 从今天起才是真正的开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尽情碰撞你们炽热的心吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心 燃烧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第二天也状态绝佳啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马 状态好 真少见。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿 这次大会上的我可不一样哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么啊 那是什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是心之碎片！已经集齐3个了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就按这个势头 一口气拿下决赛出场权！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）真是有点得意忘形了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）快点来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）呼哈呼哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男同学。还有委员长。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙 干劲十足啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快啊，委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等我……哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点啊。要迟到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～你慌什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你听我说！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁啊？这是。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）是亚洲冠军的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和鲨鱼在全国大赛决赛上交过手！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）在全国大赛上打败我的那个家伙出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了把我引进陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.29,0:04:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把无关的人给……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）鲨鱼说的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个男人吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们接下来要和他决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.21,0:04:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是他指名要求的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙不是个很危险的对手吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了获胜不择手段的那种……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像他那样绅士的决斗者　可没有啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果能和他决斗说到底{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经没有遗憾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）哦～　得赶紧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）对啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，等等啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.73,0:04:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要在这种地方决斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为是这种地方，才能和他慢慢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗不是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，说得没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:04:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）是他！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是福……先生吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.53,0:05:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你们久等了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.35,0:05:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力君，武田君。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，我们赶紧开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……在那之前请在这上面签名！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要，我也要！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乐意之至。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉丝服务可是我的信条。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非常感谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）我也来！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，请吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，开始决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男，顺序怎么安排？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，对哦。可以的话三个人一起打怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.19,0:05:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}规则是大混战。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值全部押上。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大混战？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是认真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在大混战规则下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除了自己以外的所有人都是敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是铁男和班长的目标应该是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，实际上这2对1的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是高手在这种条件下也压倒性地不利。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想让你们知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的无限可能性。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是你们说不定也能打败我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是所谓的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘛 这不是挺帅的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜世界决斗嘉年华 预选赛第2天！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集齐5个心之碎片只有完成的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能拿到通往决赛的门票。也就是获得决赛资格。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也一定要集齐心之碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打进决赛！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你们先请。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大乱斗规则明明是越往后出牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就越不利{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然特意让先攻……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我先来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤爱爱铁！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爱～爱！爱 爱 爱～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在大乱斗规则中，所有玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在第一个回合都不能攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤调试者X！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿，你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然召唤出这么独特的怪兽呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才像样嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然我也没战斗的意义了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被铁男君夸奖了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！但是别大意！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，再盖放两张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动场地魔法 超量·斗兽场！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡会让场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽·超量的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升２００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}禁止怪兽·超量以外的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样，我的回合就结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…墓地？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.15,0:10:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怪兽·超量限制…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要用这种场地魔法…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，对手的怪兽·超量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力也会上升……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要召唤怪兽·超量，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要２只以上　相同等级的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在凑齐之前　他是打算用超量·斗技场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来挡住我们的攻击吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过　可没那么容易。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤　铁皮金鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果手牌里还有１只　铁皮金鱼的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能把它特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤　铁皮金鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来他的场上就有３只等级４的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来真的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用２只等级４的铁皮金鱼和
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁皮眼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用３只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.10,0:10:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！铁皮大公！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！怪兽·超量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然已经召唤出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·斗技场的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果，身为怪兽·超量的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁皮大公的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升２００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！铁皮大公的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.13,0:11:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用１个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手怪兽的表示形式变更！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到居然这么轻易我的里侧守备怪兽就……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底是多么厉害的决斗者啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是……是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男君！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然又被夸奖了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底实在是太让人羡慕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把的里侧守备怪兽变成攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放的是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡·婴儿脸！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力为零的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可是个好机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用铁皮大公
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.51,0:12:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对机关傀儡·婴儿脸发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.01,0:12:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大公的一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.57,0:12:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 修复傀儡发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在等级4以下的傀儡怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被战斗破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将同一只怪兽从卡组特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 机关傀儡·婴儿脸！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那种怪兽对我可不管用！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁皮大公的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手怪兽的表示形式改变！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁皮大公一回合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以多次使用效果吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说…这下可不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这岂不是超厉害！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊！虽然是两个人联手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定能赢过亚洲冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这说不定真的说不定哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亏你还是那样的人物居然大意了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.48,0:13:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的怪兽攻击力为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里，如果能打出1600以上的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 调试者Z！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}调试者Z召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果场上有 调试者X也就是说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以把 调试者Y从卡组特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！ 等级3的怪兽有3只！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用等级3的 调试者X Y Z 这3只
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 疫苗少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再根据 超量竞技场的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升 200点！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮 委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 疫苗少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}疫苗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！ 这样下去的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.09,0:14:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮，委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.57,0:14:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是！打赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）哎呀，真是精彩。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害的攻势。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，我并没有受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……明明把怪兽破坏掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾，刚才那次攻击我已经{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱发动了机关盒。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在战斗产生伤害的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那份伤害无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从陷阱卡转换为怪兽卡，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，无效化的伤害数值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为这家伙的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长大人，我们快走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果刚才的攻击都没能逼他们使出来的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们就没有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们也在收集 No.卡吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多该让他们接受了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我真正的粉丝福利。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予希望，再将其夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是在那个瞬间，人类才会露出最美丽的表情。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.91,0:15:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为他们献上这个，就是我的粉丝福利。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的决斗太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}配合和战略都是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 然而！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要想打倒我 根本就是差得远呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 机关傀儡·稻草人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡 等级交错！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是将1张手牌送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让1只等级4以下的怪兽的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好品味吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的粉丝福利！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级8的机关箱和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}稻草人进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.15！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自地狱的使者操纵命运之线的人偶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡·巨人杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳、纳、No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是 No.吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:17:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，由于超量竞技场的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升２００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，我发动巨人杀手的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗１个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合，将对手的怪兽·超量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，你们这些家伙将受到被破坏的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（２人）什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁皮大公的攻击力是２４００！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是俺的粉丝福利！收下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:17:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一个，就是你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）我要把你超量怪兽破坏掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，将那攻击力数值的伤害赐予你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了……真美啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张因痛苦而扭曲的脸。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因如此，我才
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.57,0:18:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有提供服务的价值啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈……真正的粉丝服务现在才要开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动墓地中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡·宝贝脸的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中被破坏的　这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存在于自己墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.03,0:18:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏这些的对方怪兽也
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.35,0:19:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同样存在于其自身墓地时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将复活的宝贝脸除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.95,0:19:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就可以将铁皮大公和疫苗少女
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.99,0:19:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.70,0:19:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地召唤铁男的怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这一瞬间　铁皮大公因{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量竞技场的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升２００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量竞技场　就是为了这个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然特意让敌人的怪兽复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是　循环攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们是被破灭之线操控的木偶人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从我的支配中是无法逃脱的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兴奋兴奋　疫苗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.14,0:20:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次破坏你们的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好尝尝这份痛苦吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是将敌人的怪兽从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拖出来并破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将相当于怪兽攻击力的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次给予对方玩家的　循环攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的粉丝服务可不会结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！　胜负已经分出来了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.41,0:20:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你难道不明白　他们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很享受粉丝服务吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧　巨人杀手！　最终之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.83,0:20:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}委员长！铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座墓难道是打倒的决斗者的……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，没事吧！？喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你竟敢做这种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！撑住！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.97,0:21:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起我，先管委员长……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你干了什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙真的一直憧憬着你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可你为什么要这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明星，就是要将一切献给粉丝。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}献上那一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？我绝不原谅你跟我打！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也成为我的粉丝了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.88,0:22:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你头号粉丝的脸啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.30,0:24:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 游马！你放屁了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.83,0:24:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 不是我啊！干这事的是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.86,0:24:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 是星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.46,0:24:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 放屁是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.23,0:24:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放屁就是屁啦 屁。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.37,0:24:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～。

